<h1>Wheelhouse</h1>

<p>Someone asked to choose a new password for the Wheelhouse account <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong>.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %></p>

<p>
  The link works once, for <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
  If you didn't ask for it, ignore this email: your password stays the same.
</p>

<p>Wheelhouse, the bike repair workshop</p>
